WEBVTT

00:34:57.859 --> 00:35:00.804
where worrying is basically
an attempt at problem-solving

00:35:00.828 --> 00:35:03.326
and trying to figure out,
"OK, what could go wrong?

00:35:03.350 --> 00:35:06.356
What's that next worst thing?
How do I avoid it?"

00:35:06.380 --> 00:35:08.806
And rumination is when
you get stuck in a loop,

00:35:08.830 --> 00:35:11.066
just worrying about the situation,

00:35:11.090 --> 00:35:13.423
but not trying to act in the face of it.

00:35:14.007 --> 00:35:16.046
Did you have strategies

00:35:16.070 --> 00:35:18.786
for making sure that the stuff
you were worried about

00:35:18.810 --> 00:35:20.406
didn't cause you to ruminate?

00:35:20.430 --> 00:35:21.946
SK: Oh yeah, I think so,

00:35:21.970 --> 00:35:27.321
and I think that's part of
our nature as astronauts

00:35:27.345 --> 00:35:31.056
is to understand
that bad things can happen.